  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The toy-top (initially at rest)&nbsp;shown in the figure, has a moment of inertia <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and it is&nbsp;free to rotate about the stationary axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></math>. The&nbsp;string wrapped around the&nbsp;peg&nbsp;of the toy-top is pulled outwards without&nbsp;letting it slip and simultaneously maintaining&nbsp;a constant tension of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>625</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ω</mi></math>&nbsp;is the angular speed (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rad</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) of the top after&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;of string has been pulled off the peg, then mark your answer as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>ω</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0057_c42cbd348f35.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 230px;\" /></p>\r"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1.50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Work done<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mtext>F</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>Δ</mi><mtext>r</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>5.625</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>4.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>J</mtext></mrow> </math> and<br /><br />work done <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mi>Δ</mi><mtext>K</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <msubsup> <mrow> <mtext>Iω</mtext></mrow> <mtext>r</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msubsup> <mo>−</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <msubsup> <mrow> <mtext>Iω</mtext></mrow> <mtext>1</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msubsup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><mn>4.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup> <mrow> <mn>10</mn></mrow> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow> </msup> <mo>×</mo><msubsup> <mtext>ω</mtext> <mtext>r</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msubsup> <mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>...</mn></mrow> </math> (<math> <mo>∵</mo> </math> top starts from rest, <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>ω</mi> <mtext>i</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math>)<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>ω</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>rad/s</mtext></mrow> </math>"
  }
